  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSF RRM 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MSF RRM 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RRM is a funding modality that allows the organization to respond to  unpredictable emergencies and quickly meet urgent humanitarian needs. MSF interventions usually focus on providing emergency medical care,  therapeutic/supplementary feeding, mass vaccination, a response to    communicable disease outbreaks and distribution of non-food items.    MSF targets vulnerable groups.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RRM &#xe4;r ett finansieringss&#xe4;tt som m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r f&#xf6;r organisationen att     svara p&#xe5; of&#xf6;rutsedda kriser och snabbt m&#xf6;ta br&#xe5;dskande humanit&#xe4;ra     behov. MSFs projekt fokuserar p&#xe5; att ge akut medicinsk v&#xe5;rd,          nutritionsst&#xf6;d till akut undern&#xe4;rda barn, massvaccinering, svara emot sjukdomsutbrott, samt distribution av humanit&#xe4;ra f&#xf6;rn&#xf6;denheter.       L&#xe4;kare utan Gr&#xe4;nser riktar sig till s&#xe4;rskilt utsatta grupper.</narrative>
  </description>
